---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Blog | Creattia" description="Descubrí las últimas tendencias, mejores prácticas e insights sobre publicidad con IA en el blog de Creattia.">
	<header class="floating-header">
		<a class="logo-bubble" href="/" aria-label="Creattia, volver al inicio">
			<img src="/images/creattia/moki-mascot.webp" alt="Creattia Logo" width="1254" height="1254" />
		</a>
		<nav class="nav-links">
			<a href="/#como-funciona">Cómo funciona</a>
			<a href="/#biblioteca">Biblioteca</a>
			<a href="/#precios">Precios</a>
			<a href="/app/">Ingresar</a>
		</nav>
		<a class="outline-cta" href="/app/">Empezar gratis <span>→</span></a>
	</header>

	<main class="blog-page">
		<section class="blog-content">
			<h1>El Blog de Creattia</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">Consejos prácticos, insights y guías para escalar las ventas de tu negocio con inteligencia artificial.</p>

			<div class="blog-empty">
				<span>✍️</span>
				<h2>Estamos preparando el primer contenido.</h2>
				<p>Volvé pronto o probá la plataforma mientras tanto — es gratis para empezar.</p>
				<a class="outline-cta" href="/app/">Empezar gratis →</a>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>

	<footer class="main-footer">
		<div class="footer-brand">
			<a class="logo-bubble" href="/">
				<img src="/images/creattia/moki-mascot.webp" alt="Creattia" />
			</a>
			<h3>Creattia</h3>
			<p>Imágenes y creativos publicitarios que aceleran las ventas de tu negocio.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="links-group">
			<h4>Compañía</h4>
			<a href="/#como-funciona">Cómo funciona</a>
			<a href="/#precios">Precios</a>
			<a href="/sobre-nosotros/">Sobre nosotros</a>
		</div>
		<div class="links-group">
			<h4>Recursos</h4>
			<a href="/app/">Biblioteca de ideas</a>
			<a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
		</div>
		<div class="links-group">
			<h4>Legal</h4>
			<a href="/privacidad/">Privacidad</a>
			<a href="/terminos/">Términos</a>
		</div>
		<div class="footer-bottom">
			<p>© 2026 Creattia. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
		</div>
	</footer>
</Layout>

<style>
	:global(html) {
		background-color: #FFF;
	}
	
	:global(body) {
		background-color: #FFF;
	}

	.floating-header {
		position: fixed;
		top: 20px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
		height: 70px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
		border-radius: 35px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		padding: 0 10px 0 20px;
		z-index: 100;
	}

	.logo-bubble {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.logo-bubble img {
		width: 32px;
		height: 32px;
		border-radius: 50%;
	}

	.nav-links {
		display: none;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 24px;
	}

	@media (min-width: 810px) {
		.nav-links {
			display: flex;
		}
	}

	.nav-links a {
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: #1D1D1F;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: opacity 0.2s;
	}

	.nav-links a:hover {
		opacity: 0.7;
	}

	.outline-cta {
		display: none;
		height: 48px;
		padding: 0 24px;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		border-radius: 24px;
		background: linear-gradient(104deg, rgb(62, 134, 198) 0%, rgb(166, 102, 170) 22%, rgb(236, 68, 146) 50%, rgb(238, 68, 84) 76%, rgb(240, 84, 39) 100%);
		border: none;
		color: #FFF;
		font-size: 15px;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(236, 68, 146, 0.2);
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}

	@media (min-width: 810px) {
		.outline-cta {
			display: inline-flex;
		}
	}

	.outline-cta:hover {
		transform: scale(1.03);
		box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(236, 68, 146, 0.35);
	}

	.blog-page {
		padding: 140px 20px 80px;
		background: #FFF;
	}

	.blog-content {
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif;
		color: #1D1D1F;
	}

	.blog-content h1 {
		font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
	}

	.subtitle {
		font-size: 18px;
		color: #6E6E73;
		margin-bottom: 60px;
		font-weight: 500;
		max-width: 720px;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.blog-empty {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 80px 20px;
		border: 1px solid #E6E6E7;
		border-radius: 24px;
		background: #FAFAFA;
	}

	.blog-empty span {
		font-size: 40px;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}

	.blog-empty h2 {
		font-size: 22px;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0;
		color: #1D1D1F;
	}

	.blog-empty p {
		font-size: 15px;
		color: #6E6E73;
		margin: 0 0 20px;
		max-width: 380px;
	}

	.blog-empty .outline-cta {
		display: inline-flex;
	}

	.main-footer {
		background: #FFF;
		padding: 80px 20px 40px;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: 40px;
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif;
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.main-footer {
			grid-template-columns: 1.5fr repeat(3, 1fr);
		}
	}

	.footer-brand {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 16px;
	}

	.footer-brand h3 {
		font-size: 18px;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.footer-brand p {
		font-size: 14px;
		color: #6E6E73;
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 240px;
	}

	.links-group {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 12px;
	}

	.links-group h4 {
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #1D1D1F;
		margin: 0 0 4px;
	}

	.links-group a {
		font-size: 14px;
		color: #6E6E73;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}

	.links-group a:hover {
		color: #1D1D1F;
	}

	.footer-bottom {
		grid-column: 1 / -1;
		border-top: 1px solid #E6E6E7;
		padding-top: 30px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.footer-bottom p {
		font-size: 13px;
		color: #8E8E93;
		margin: 0;
	}
</style>
